      <title>Strongswan 1: 编译报错及解决办法</title>
      <link href="/2026/02/03/3-Strongswan-%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%E5%8F%8A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%8A%9E%E6%B3%95/"/>
      <url>/2026/02/03/3-Strongswan-%E7%BC%96%E8%AF%91%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99%E5%8F%8A%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%8A%9E%E6%B3%95/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>在编译 Strongswan 时，遇到了一些报错信息，经过排查和解决，记录如下。</p><h2><span id="目录">📑 目录</span></h2><h3><span id="autogensh-阶段">autogen.sh 阶段</span></h3><table><thead><tr><th>错误类型</th><th>解决方案</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#autoconf-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">autoconf 报错</a></td><td>安装 autoconf</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#libtool-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">libtool 报错</a></td><td>安装 libtool</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#gettext-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">gettext 报错</a></td><td>安装 gettext</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><span id="configure-阶段">configure 阶段</span></h3><table><thead><tr><th>错误类型</th><th>解决方案</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#gperf-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">gperf 报错</a></td><td>安装 gperf</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#gmp-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">gmp 报错</a></td><td>安装 libgmp-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#ldap-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">ldap 报错</a></td><td>安装 libldap2-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#curl-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">curl 报错</a></td><td>安装 libcurl4-openssl-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#dns-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">dns 报错</a></td><td>安装 libldns-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#unbound-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">unbound 报错</a></td><td>安装 libunbound-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#soup-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">soup 报错</a></td><td>安装 libsoup2.4-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#systemd-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">systemd 报错</a></td><td>安装 libsystemd-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#libtspi-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">libtspi 报错</a></td><td>安装 trousers libtspi-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#tss2-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">tss2 报错</a></td><td>安装 libtss2-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#json-c-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">json-c 报错</a></td><td>安装 libjson-c-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#neo_utl-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">neo_utl 报错</a></td><td>安装 clearsilver-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#fcgi-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">fcgi 报错</a></td><td>安装 libfcgi-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#mysql-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">mysql 报错</a></td><td>安装 libmysqlclient-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#wolfssl-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">wolfssl 报错</a></td><td>安装 libwolfssl-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#gcrypt-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">gcrypt 报错</a></td><td>安装 libgcrypt-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#botan-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">botan 报错</a></td><td>安装 libbotan-2-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#pcsclite-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">pcsclite 报错</a></td><td>安装 libpcsclite-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#nm-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">nm 报错</a></td><td>安装 libnm-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#uci-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">uci 报错</a></td><td>手动编译安装 UCI</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#cutils-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">cutils 报错</a></td><td>安装 android-libcutils-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#ip4tc-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">ip4tc 报错</a></td><td>安装 libip4tc-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#gprbuild-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">gprbuild 报错</a></td><td>安装 gprbuild</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#make-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">make 报错</a></td><td>安装 make</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><span id="make-阶段">make 阶段</span></h3><table><thead><tr><th>错误类型</th><th>解决方案</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#bison-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">bison 报错</a></td><td>安装 bison</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#flex-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">flex 报错</a></td><td>安装 flex</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#setuptools-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">setuptools 报错</a></td><td>pip install setuptools</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#gprbuild-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99-1">gprbuild 报错</a></td><td>安装 gnat gprbuild</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#unwind-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">unwind 报错</a></td><td>安装 libunwind-dev</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#cov-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">cov 报错</a></td><td>安装 lcov</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#gem-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">gem 报错</a></td><td>安装 ruby-full</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#easy_install-%E6%8A%A5%E9%94%99">easy_install 报错</a></td><td>安装 python-setuptools</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2><span id="详细错误信息">📌 详细错误信息</span></h2><h3><span id="autogensh-报错">autogen.sh 报错</span></h3><hr><h4><span id="1-autoconf-报错">1. autoconf 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">Command <span class="string">&#x27;autoreconf&#x27;</span> not found, but can be installed with:</span><br><span class="line">apt install autoconf</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> autoreconf 是 autoconf 工具的一个子命令，用于自动生成 configure 脚本。如果没有安装 autoreconf，就会报错。</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 autoconf 工具</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install autoconf</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="2-libtool-报错">2. libtool 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">Can<span class="string">&#x27;t exec &quot;libtoolize&quot;: 没有那个文件或目录 at /usr/share/autoconf/Autom4te/FileUtils.pm line 345, &lt;GEN3&gt; line 4.</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">autoreconf: failed to run libtoolize: No such file or directory</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">autoreconf: libtoolize is needed because this package uses Libtool</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> libtoolize 是 libtool 工具的一个子命令，用于自动生成 libtool 脚本。如果没有安装 libtoolize，就会报错。</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 libtool 工具</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install libtool</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="3-gettext-报错">3. gettext 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">configure.ac:379: error: possibly undefined macro: AC_LIB_PREFIX</span><br><span class="line">     If this token and others are legitimate, please use m4_pattern_allow.</span><br><span class="line">     See the Autoconf documentation.</span><br><span class="line">autoreconf: /usr/bin/autoconf failed with <span class="built_in">exit</span> status: 1</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> 用于解决 AC_LIB_PREFIX 宏没有定义问题，以前的解决方法是：<code>cp -rf /usr/share/aclocal/* /usr/local/share/aclocal/</code> 但是不能从根源上解决问题</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 gettext</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install gettext</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h3><span id="configure-报错">configure 报错</span></h3><hr><h4><span id="1-gperf-报错">1. gperf 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking gperf len <span class="built_in">type</span>... not found</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: GNU gperf required to generate e.g. ./src/libstrongswan/crypto/proposal/proposal_keywords_static.c</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> 编译过程中需要使用 GNU gperf 生成一些静态文件</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 gperf</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install gperf</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="2-gmp-报错">2. gmp 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">configure: error: GNU Multi Precision library gmp not found</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> Strongswan 需要 GNU Multi Precision 库来进行大数运算</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 gmp 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libgmp-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="3-ldap-报错">3. ldap 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking <span class="keyword">for</span> ldap_init <span class="keyword">in</span> -lldap... no</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: LDAP library ldap not found</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> LDAP 支持库未找到</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 LDAP 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libldap2-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="4-curl-报错">4. curl 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking <span class="keyword">for</span> curl_global_init <span class="keyword">in</span> -lcurl... no</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: CURL library curl not found</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> CURL 支持库未找到</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 CURL 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libcurl4-openssl-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="5-dns-报错">5. dns 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking <span class="keyword">for</span> ldns_rr_get_type <span class="keyword">in</span> -lldns... no</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: UNBOUND library ldns not found</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> DNS 支持库未找到</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 DNS 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libldns-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="6-unbound-报错">6. unbound 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking <span class="keyword">for</span> ub_ctx_create <span class="keyword">in</span> -lunbound... no</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: UNBOUND library libunbound not found</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> Unbound DNS 解析库未找到</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 Unbound 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libunbound-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="7-soup-报错">7. soup 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">configure: error: Package requirements (libsoup-2.4) were not met:</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">No package <span class="string">&#x27;libsoup-2.4&#x27;</span> found</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Consider adjusting the PKG_CONFIG_PATH environment variable <span class="keyword">if</span> you</span><br><span class="line">installed software <span class="keyword">in</span> a non-standard prefix.</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Alternatively, you may <span class="built_in">set</span> the environment variables soup_CFLAGS</span><br><span class="line">and soup_LIBS to avoid the need to call pkg-config.</span><br><span class="line">See the pkg-config man page <span class="keyword">for</span> more details.</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> libsoup-2.4 库未找到</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 libsoup2.4 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libsoup2.4-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="8-systemd-报错">8. systemd 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">configure: error: Package requirements (libsystemd-daemon) were not met:</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">No package <span class="string">&#x27;libsystemd-daemon&#x27;</span> found</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Consider adjusting the PKG_CONFIG_PATH environment variable <span class="keyword">if</span> you</span><br><span class="line">installed software <span class="keyword">in</span> a non-standard prefix.</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Alternatively, you may <span class="built_in">set</span> the environment variables systemd_daemon_CFLAGS</span><br><span class="line">and systemd_daemon_LIBS to avoid the need to call pkg-config.</span><br><span class="line">See the pkg-config man page <span class="keyword">for</span> more details.</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> libsystemd-daemon 库未找到</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 systemd 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libsystemd-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="9-libtspi-报错">9. libtspi 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">configure: error: TrouSerS library libtspi not found</span><br><span class="line">make: *** 没有指明目标并且找不到 makefile。 停止。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> TrouSerS TPM 库未找到</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 TrouSerS 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install trousers libtspi-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="10-tss2-报错">10. tss2 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">configure: error: <span class="keyword">in</span> `/home/share/qin.yuan/compile/module/wtd/ike/strongswan-5.9.6<span class="string">&#x27;:</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">configure: error: no TSS2 TCTI or SAPI libraries detected</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">See `config.log&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">for</span> more details</span><br><span class="line">make: *** 没有指明目标并且找不到 makefile。 停止。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> TSS2 (Trusted Software Stack 2.0) 库未找到</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 TSS2 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libtss2-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="11-json-c-报错">11. json-c 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">configure: error: Package requirements (json) were not met:</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">No package <span class="string">&#x27;json&#x27;</span> found</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class=