ass="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libip4tc-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="23-gprbuild-报错">23. gprbuild 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking <span class="keyword">for</span> gprbuild... no</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: gprbuild not found</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> 这个错误表明系统缺少 Ada 项目的构建工具 gprbuild</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 gprbuild</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install gprbuild</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="24-make-报错">24. make 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">config.log 出现很多基础函数库和头文件找不到；</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> 缺少基础的编译工具</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 make</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install make</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h3><span id="make-报错">make 报错</span></h3><hr><h4><span id="1-bison-报错">1. bison 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">  YACC     settings/settings_parser.c</span><br><span class="line">../../ylwrap: 行 176: yacc：未找到命令</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> 这个错误表明系统缺少 yacc 解析器生成器工具</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 bison</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install bison</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="2-flex-报错">2. flex 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">gcc: error: settings/settings_lexer.c: 没有那个文件或目录</span><br><span class="line">gcc: fatal error: no input files</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>错误原因：</strong> 这个错误表明系统缺少由 flex 生成的词法分析器文件。需要先安装词法分析器生成工具并重新生成文件</p><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 flex</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install flex</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="3-setuptools-报错">3. setuptools 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">Traceback (most recent call last):</span><br><span class="line">  File <span class="string">&quot;setup.py&quot;</span>, line <span class="number">1</span>, <span class="keyword">in</span> &lt;module&gt;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">from</span> setuptools <span class="keyword">import</span> setup</span><br><span class="line">ModuleNotFoundError: No module named <span class="string">&#x27;setuptools&#x27;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 setuptools</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">pip install --upgrade setuptools</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="4-gprbuild-报错">4. gprbuild 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">gprconfig: can<span class="string">&#x27;t find a native toolchain for language &#x27;</span>ada<span class="string">&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">build_common.gpr:1:06: unknown project file: &quot;tkmrpc_client&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">build_common.gpr:2:06: unknown project file: &quot;tkmrpc_server-ees&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 gnat 和 gprbuild</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install gnat gprbuild</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="5-unwind-报错">5. unwind 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking <span class="keyword">for</span> unw_backtrace <span class="keyword">in</span> -lunwind... no</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: libunwind not found!</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 libunwind 开发包</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install libunwind-dev</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="6-cov-报错">6. cov 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking <span class="keyword">for</span> lcov... no</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: lcov not found</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 lcov</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install lcov</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="7-gem-报错">7. gem 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking <span class="keyword">for</span> gem... no</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: RubyGems package manager not found</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 Ruby</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install ruby-full</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h4><span id="8-easy_install-报错">8. easy_install 报错</span></h4><p><strong>错误信息：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">checking <span class="keyword">for</span> easy_install... no</span><br><span class="line">configure: error: Python easy_install not found</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>解决办法：</strong> 安装 Python setuptools</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 方法一（可能不管用）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt-get install python-setuptools</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 方法二（推荐）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt update</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> apt install curl</span><br><span class="line">curl https://bootstrap.pypa.io/ez_setup.py --output ez_setup.py</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> python ez_setup.py</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2><span id="️-未解决问题">⚠️ 未解决问题</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th>问题</th><th>解决方案</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Windows 编译：找不到 “win32_socket.h”</td><td>使用 <code>--disable-winhttp</code> 禁用 Windows HTTP 支持</td></tr><tr><td>汇编问题</td><td>使用 <code>--disable-padlock</code> 禁用 Padlock 支持</td></tr><tr><td>macOS 编译问题</td><td>使用 <code>--disable-keychain</code> 禁用 Keychain 支持</td></tr></tbody></table>]]></content>
      
      
